Z||000002||Monkeyman||10-05-2001||07:25 PM||||I installed Monroe SensaTracs on the Grape Ape.  I have no idea what the part number was (BAMBAM might if he's still around as I bought them off of him), but I didn't have any problems.  Mine seemed to be the correct length, though.  You might try cross referencing the Monroe part number with a KYB or Koni part number and see what comes up.||||reg||1
